  <Description Lang="en">ServiceCatalog compatibility update for TESSERA service YAML fields and package upgrade restoration.</Description>
  <IntroUpgrade Type="post" Lang="en" Title="ServiceCatalog">
        Restores available ServiceCatalog-owned files and updates service import/export so service YAML imports resolve service Type values through ITSM::Service::Type and update existing services when overwrite is selected.
    </IntroUpgrade>
